      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>On the Quai de l'Amiral Courbet, right by the harbour of Villefranche-sur-Mer, Achill's serves Mediterranean cuisine with a view over the bay.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The official Nice Côte d'Azur tourist office listing references this restaurant, and a detailed customer review on TripAdvisor explicitly describes a team that was "super attentive" towards their dog during the meal.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: the harbour of Villefranche is especially lovely at the end of the day, with the light on the colourful façades.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Citadelle Saint-Elme and the lanes of old Villefranche are easy to explore after the meal.</p>
